      "input": "https://visitors.example.com/pa\tss#Xo3_vK9-aQ2rT7mN4bL8cY1zW6eH5jP0sD-gF_uIk2A",
      "expected": null
    },
    {
      "name": "leading byte order mark (U+FEFF) is trimmed",
      "input": "\ufeffXo3_vK9-aQ2rT7mN4bL8cY1zW6eH5jP0sD-gF_uIk2A",
